{
  "what": "Per-attempt success probability p measured directly on the Radeon-hosted model, by drawing 192 INDEPENDENT candidates per task and verifying every one against the same synthesized oracle. 960 generations, 5 task difficulties.",
  "hardware": "AMD Radeon Cloud, ROCm 7.2.1, vLLM 0.16.1, Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct",
  "sampling": "temperature 0.6 fixed (so draws are i.i.d. and p is well defined), concurrency 32 -- the optimum measured in the K-sweep, used to run this experiment faster",
